w span along Line 67 off Monterey Bay, in the 27\u201359 m depth-averaged ADCP discussion. International-nautical-mile normalization is 64.82 km; display about 65 km. Campaign 23\u201330 January 2008, exact occupation date unknown. Course cruise report; peer review and publication date unverified. No paired edges, velocity cutoff, error, flow-normal orientation, whole-current width or annual range established.","source_date":null,"source_id":"source:wallace-davidson-2008-course-report","source_locator":"PDF page 8, section IV.A ADCP; continuation on PDF page 9; Figure6 on PDF page 22","source_locator_status":"specific","source_publication_year":null,"source_snapshot_id":null,"subject_id":"current:davidson","support_claim_id":null,"target_collection":"widths","target_id":"davidson-wallace-2008-line67-27-59m-reported-span","time_precision":"campaign_window_only_not_exact_width_occupation","unit":"km","value":65},{"assertion_status":"reported_or_derived_measurement","evidence_class":"derived_lower_bound","id":"claim:measurement:baffin:described-latitude-floor","method":"plans/baffin-latitude-gate-bound-protocol-v1.md","method_source_id":"source:baffin-latitude-gate-bound-v1","method_status":"described","object_id":null,"observation_time":null,"predicate":"length_lower_bound","review_date":null,"review_fingerprint":"06e538a87b93d1dc57abbd09fb7e78fc1b674accdf9f8b70802f12b054964f2e","review_note":"Internal selected-source, arithmetic and role-lens review; no external scientific review claimed.","review_status":"not_individually_reviewed","reviewer":null,"scope":"Conditional WGS84 geographic floor between the source-described 67 and 76 degrees N gates. Summer near-surface observations in 1978 and 1979; exact gate dates and common fixed layer unknown. The author extends historical Baffin Current naming north to Lady Ann Strait. No simultaneous connected axis, whole-current length or guaranteed physical minimum established. Lancaster Sound intrusion and meanders are not reco